.TH "nvme_init_set_features_voltage_measurement" 9 "nvme_init_set_features_voltage_measurement" "October 2026" "libnvme API manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
nvme_init_set_features_voltage_measurement \- Initialize passthru command for Voltage Measurement
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B "void" nvme_init_set_features_voltage_measurement
.BI "(struct libnvme_passthru_cmd *cmd "  ","
.BI "bool sv "  ","
.BI "__u8 act "  ","
.BI "struct nvme_voltage_measurement_start_data *data "  ");"
.SH ARGUMENTS
.IP "cmd" 12
Passthru command to use
.IP "sv" 12
Save value across power states
.IP "act" 12
Action (ACT), see \fIenum nvme_voltage_measurement_act\fP
.IP "data" 12
Start Voltage Measurements data buffer, used if \fIact\fP is
NVME_VOLTAGE_MEASUREMENT_ACT_START, otherwise NULL, see
\fIstruct nvme_voltage_measurement_start_data\fP
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Initializes the passthru command buffer for the Set Features command with
FID value NVME_FEAT_FID_VOLTAGE_MEASUREMENT
